(1) $\omega_0 = \frac{6\sqrt{3}}{7}\frac{I}{ma}$

(2) $I \ge I_0 = m\sqrt{\frac{7(2-\sqrt{3})}{9}ga}$

(3) $\omega_1 = -\frac{42}{221-72\sqrt{3}}\frac{I_0}{ma}$，$\omega_2$ 表达式因OCR损坏缺失。

(4) 方程组为
$$
\begin{cases}
11\beta_1 - 3(3-\sqrt{3})\beta_2 = 3\sqrt{3}\omega_1^2 - 6\sqrt{3}\omega_1\omega_2 - 9\omega_2^2 \\
4(3-\sqrt{3})\beta_1 + 7\beta_2 = 3\sqrt{3}\omega_2^2 - \frac{6g}{a}
\end{cases}
$$
